#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:4
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:6
msgid ""
"A deployment is monitored at three levels: the state of each node, "
"reported by ``anet status`` and ``anet doctor``; the process-level health"
" of a hub, reported by its HTTP endpoints and logs; and the state of the "
"hub's ledger and federation, reported by the operator subcommands. This "
"page lists the commands, the shape of their output, and the signals that "
"call for action."
msgstr ""
"部署从三个层面进行监控:各节点的状态,由 ``anet status`` 和 ``anet doctor`` 报告;hub 的进程级健康状况,由其"
" HTTP 端点和日志报告;hub 账本与联邦的状态,由运维子命令报告。本页列出这些命令、输出的形式,以及需要采取行动的信号。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:18
msgid "Node"
msgstr "节点"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:21
msgid "``anet status``"
msgstr "``anet status``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:23
msgid ""
"``anet status`` prints one line per topic, each with a label, a sentence "
"and, where a next step exists, an indented line that starts with an "
"arrow. The sentences are the same as those returned by the MCP tool "
"``node_status`` and the local A2A interface."
msgstr ""
"``anet status`` 每个主题输出一行,包含标签、一句话说明,以及(存在下一步操作时)一行以箭头开头的缩进文字。这些语句与 MCP 工具"
" ``node_status`` 和本地 A2A 接口返回的相同。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:37
msgid ""
"The lines appear in this order, and a line appears only when its "
"condition holds:"
msgstr "各行按下列顺序出现,且仅在其条件成立时出现:"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:44
msgid "Topic"
msgstr "主题"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:45
msgid "Condition and content"
msgstr "条件与内容"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:46
msgid "``identity``"
msgstr "``identity``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:47
msgid ""
"Unless the node has not joined a hub. The state of the identity: key "
"confirmed, confirmation ageing, stopped, deactivated."
msgstr "节点已加入 hub 时出现。身份的状态:密钥已确认、确认已过时、已停止、已停用。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:49
msgid "``recovery``"
msgstr "``recovery``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:50
msgid ""
"When the identity has no recovery passphrase. Followed by ``→ anet "
"identity protect``."
msgstr "身份没有恢复口令时出现。后接 ``→ anet identity protect``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:52
msgid "``hub``"
msgstr "``hub``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:53
msgid ""
"Always. Registered, waiting for admission, retrying, refused, or a wire "
"version that does not match."
msgstr "始终出现。已注册、等待准入、重试中、被拒绝,或线路协议版本不匹配。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:55
msgid "``delivery``"
msgstr "``delivery``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:56
msgid "When outbound messages are waiting for confirmation or are stuck."
msgstr "有外发消息在等待确认或已卡住时出现。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:57
msgid "``inbound``"
msgstr "``inbound``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:58
msgid ""
"Always. Policy, the number of allowed peers and public capabilities, and "
"whether auto-reply is on."
msgstr "始终出现。策略、允许的对等方数量和公开能力数量,以及自动回复是否开启。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:60
msgid "``sandbox``"
msgstr "``sandbox``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:61
msgid "When untrusted or trusted callers are served by a sandbox."
msgstr "不受信任或受信任的调用方由沙箱提供服务时出现。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:62
msgid "``payments``"
msgstr "``payments``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:63
msgid "Always. Limits and what has been paid today."
msgstr "始终出现。限额以及当日已支付的金额。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:64
msgid "``privacy``"
msgstr "``privacy``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:65
msgid ""
"Always. The retention period, or a clock warning, or a detected rollback "
"of the node's data."
msgstr "始终出现。保留期、时钟警告,或检测到的节点数据回滚。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:67 ../../ops/monitoring.rst:190
msgid "``preview``"
msgstr "``preview``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:68
msgid "When preview streaming is on."
msgstr "开启预览流式传输时出现。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:70
msgid ""
"``anet status --json`` prints the complete status object with the same "
"sentences in its ``summary`` member. A node whose daemon is not running "
"prints a single sentence and the next step, ``anet up``."
msgstr ""
"``anet status --json`` 输出完整的状态对象,其 ``summary`` "
"成员中包含相同的语句。守护进程未运行的节点只输出一句话和下一步操作 ``anet up``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:77
msgid "``anet doctor``"
msgstr "``anet doctor``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:79
msgid ""
"``anet doctor`` reports what the node is set up to do and which entry "
"points are open. It reads the data directory, writes nothing and needs no"
" running daemon; checks that need runtime data report ``unknown`` when "
"the daemon is stopped. Every finding has an identifier, a status and a "
"sentence; a finding that is not ``ok`` also names the command that "
"resolves it."
msgstr ""
"``anet doctor`` "
"报告节点已配置的行为以及哪些入口处于开放状态。它读取数据目录,不写入任何内容,也不需要守护进程在运行;需要运行时数据的检查项在守护进程停止时报告 "
"``unknown``\\ 。每条发现都有标识、状态和一句话说明;状态不是 ``ok`` 的发现还会给出解决问题所用的命令。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:102
msgid "The status values are:"
msgstr "状态值如下:"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:104
msgid "``ok``"
msgstr "``ok``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:105
msgid "The check passed."
msgstr "检查通过。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:106
msgid "``info``"
msgstr "``info``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:107
msgid ""
"A fact, or a setting that differs from a fresh installation. It is the "
"operator's choice and does not fail the report."
msgstr "一项事实,或与全新安装不同的设置。这由运维人员自行选择,不会使报告失败。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:109
msgid "``warn``"
msgstr "``warn``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:110
msgid "An attention-worthy condition that does not stop the node."
msgstr "值得关注但不会使节点停止的情况。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:111
msgid "``fail``"
msgstr "``fail``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:112
msgid "A condition that breaks the node or exposes a credential."
msgstr "使节点无法工作或暴露凭证的情况。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:113
msgid "``unknown``"
msgstr "``unknown``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:114
msgid "The check could not be made, usually because the daemon is not running."
msgstr "无法进行检查,通常是因为守护进程未运行。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:116
msgid ""
"The exit status is ``1`` if any check is ``fail``, and ``0`` otherwise. "
"With ``--json`` the report is a single object whose ``schema`` member is "
"``anet.doctor/1``. Its ``checks`` array holds objects with ``id``, "
"``status``, ``reason`` (the code of the sentence), ``detail`` and "
"``hint``; ``ok`` is ``false`` when a check failed. The identifiers are "
"stable."
msgstr ""
"任一检查项为 ``fail`` 时退出状态为 ``1``,否则为 ``0``\\ 。使用 ``--json`` 时,报告是单个对象,其 "
"``schema`` 成员为 ``anet.doctor/1``\\ 。其 ``checks`` 数组包含带有 ``id``\\ 、\\ "
"``status``\\ 、\\ ``reason``\\ (该语句的代码)、\\ ``detail`` 和 ``hint`` "
"的对象;有检查失败时 ``ok`` 为 ``false``\\ 。标识保持稳定。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:128
msgid "Checks"
msgstr "检查项"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:130
msgid ""
"Checks that do not apply to the node's configuration are not shown; for "
"example the ``sandbox`` checks appear only when a sandbox is in use."
msgstr "不适用于节点当前配置的检查项不会显示;例如只有在使用沙箱时才会出现 ``sandbox`` 检查项。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:137
msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "标识"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:138
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "检查对象"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:139
msgid "``version``, ``version.signature``"
msgstr "``version``\\ 、\\ ``version.signature``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:140
msgid "The version, and whether the binary was installed from a signed release."
msgstr "版本,以及二进制文件是否来自已签名的发布版本。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:142
msgid "``modules``"
msgstr "``modules``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:143
msgid ""
"Modules compiled in, and modules turned off in the configuration. A "
"configuration that refers to a module that is not available is a "
"``fail``."
msgstr "已编译的模块,以及在配置中关闭的模块。配置引用了不可用的模块时为 ``fail``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:146
msgid "``config``, ``config.removed``"
msgstr "``config``\\ 、\\ ``config.removed``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:147
msgid ""
"The configuration file: permissions and parseability, and keys that no "
"longer exist."
msgstr "配置文件:权限与可解析性,以及已不存在的键。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:149
msgid "``si5``"
msgstr "``si5``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:150
msgid ""
"The safety defaults of a fresh installation; the keys that differ are "
"listed."
msgstr "全新安装的安全默认值;列出与之不同的键。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:152
msgid "``control``, ``control.token``"
msgstr "``control``\\ 、\\ ``control.token``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:153
msgid "The local control plane and its token."
msgstr "本地控制面及其令牌。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:154
msgid "``identity``, ``identity.format``"
msgstr "``identity``\\ 、\\ ``identity.format``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:155
msgid "The AID, and whether the identity file is readable and of this release."
msgstr "AID,以及身份文件是否可读、是否属于本版本。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:157
msgid "``identity.witness``"
msgstr "``identity.witness``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:158
msgid ""
"Whether the hub confirms the node's current key state, and how fresh the "
"confirmation is. ``fail`` when the confirmation is too old, or when the "
"identity was stopped or deactivated elsewhere."
msgstr "hub 是否确认了节点当前的密钥状态,以及确认的新旧程度。确认过旧,或身份已在别处停止或停用时为 ``fail``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:161
msgid "``identity.recovery``"
msgstr "``identity.recovery``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:162
msgid ""
"The recovery file: present, mode ``0600``, or the warning that no "
