msgstr "恢复文件:是否存在、权限是否为 ``0600``,或尚未设置口令的警告。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:164
msgid "``identity.rotation``"
msgstr "``identity.rotation``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:165
msgid "A key rotation that has not been confirmed yet."
msgstr "尚未得到确认的密钥轮换。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:166
msgid "``hub``, ``hub.probation``"
msgstr "``hub``\\ 、\\ ``hub.probation``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:167
msgid "Registration state; probation and the trial credit, if any."
msgstr "注册状态;试用期以及试用额度(如有)。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:168
msgid "``delivery.outbox``"
msgstr "``delivery.outbox``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:169
msgid "Outbound messages that are stuck or unconfirmed."
msgstr "卡住或尚未确认的外发消息。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:170
msgid "``tasks.no_response``"
msgstr "``tasks.no_response``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:171
msgid "The time after which a task with no reply from its peer fails."
msgstr "任务在对方没有回复时判定失败的等待时间。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:172
msgid "``sender_privacy.*``"
msgstr "``sender_privacy.*``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:173
msgid ""
"The mailbox key, the sessions and delivery credentials, and the hub's "
"behaviour towards sender hiding."
msgstr "邮箱密钥、会话与投递凭证,以及 hub 对发送方隐藏的处理行为。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:175
msgid "``clock``"
msgstr "``clock``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:176
msgid "The difference between the computer's clock and the hub's."
msgstr "本机时钟与 hub 时钟的差值。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:177
msgid "``keys.epoch``"
msgstr "``keys.epoch``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:178
msgid ""
"Encryption keys published ahead of time, and expired keys kept longer "
"than necessary."
msgstr "提前发布的加密密钥,以及保留时间超过必要期限的过期密钥。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:180
msgid "``retention``"
msgstr "``retention``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:181
msgid "The retention period of task content."
msgstr "任务内容的保留期。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:182
msgid "``local_state``"
msgstr "``local_state``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:183
msgid ""
"A detected rollback of the node's data in the last 7 days. ``warn`` the "
"first time, ``fail`` when repeated."
msgstr "最近 7 天内检测到的节点数据回滚。首次为 ``warn``,重复出现时为 ``fail``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:185
msgid "``inbound``, ``inbound.lists``"
msgstr "``inbound``\\ 、\\ ``inbound.lists``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:186
msgid "Inbound policy and lists."
msgstr "入站策略与名单。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:187
msgid "``capabilities.*``"
msgstr "``capabilities.*``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:188
msgid ""
"Public capabilities: file handling, in-flight limits, capabilities open "
"only to lists."
msgstr "公开能力:文件处理、并发上限,以及仅对名单开放的能力。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:191
msgid "Preview streaming."
msgstr "预览流式传输。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:192
msgid "``payments``, ``payments.audit``, ``payments.reviews``, ``payments.card``"
msgstr ""
"``payments``\\ 、\\ ``payments.audit``\\ 、\\ ``payments.reviews``\\ 、\\ "
"``payments.card``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:193
msgid ""
"Payment limits and payees; the check of the hub's balance proof; reviews "
"waiting for upload; the extended card that carries prices."
msgstr "付款限额与收款方;对 hub 余额证明的检查;等待上传的评价;携带价格的扩展卡片。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:195
msgid "``auto_reply``, ``sandbox``, ``sandbox.*``"
msgstr "``auto_reply``\\ 、\\ ``sandbox``\\ 、\\ ``sandbox.*``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:196
msgid ""
"The auto-reply configuration and, when a sandbox is in use, its "
"readiness, upstream configuration, network egress, budget and limits."
msgstr "自动回复配置,以及(使用沙箱时)沙箱的就绪状态、上游配置、网络出口、预算和限额。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:198
msgid "``backends.peer_check``, ``backend.transport``, ``a2a.backends``"
msgstr "``backends.peer_check``\\ 、\\ ``backend.transport``\\ 、\\ ``a2a.backends``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:199
msgid "Backends of the service module."
msgstr "服务模块的后端。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:200
msgid "``anetlink.socket``, ``anetlink.publish``"
msgstr "``anetlink.socket``\\ 、\\ ``anetlink.publish``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:201
msgid "ANetLink connection and published capabilities."
msgstr "ANetLink 连接与已发布的能力。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:202
msgid "``a2a``, ``a2a.port``, ``a2a.token``"
msgstr "``a2a``\\ 、\\ ``a2a.port``\\ 、\\ ``a2a.token``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:203
msgid "The local A2A interface."
msgstr "本地 A2A 接口。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:204
msgid "``agents``, ``agents.<tool>``, ``hermes.*``"
msgstr "``agents``\\ 、\\ ``agents.<tool>``\\ 、\\ ``hermes.*``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:205
msgid "The wiring of coding agents (see :ref:`howto-coding-agents`)."
msgstr "编码 Agent 的接入配置(参见 :ref:`howto-coding-agents`)。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:206
msgid "``official``"
msgstr "``official``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:207
msgid "The signed list of official agents."
msgstr "已签名的官方 Agent 列表。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:209
msgid ""
"The sentence of every ``warn`` and ``fail`` is a code of the reason "
"table, so the same event is described in the same words by ``anet "
"status``, MCP and the local A2A interface. See :ref:`reference-reason-"
"codes`."
msgstr ""
"每条 ``warn`` 和 ``fail`` 的语句都是原因码表中的一个代码,因此 ``anet status``\\ 、MCP 和本地 A2A "
"接口会用相同的措辞描述同一事件。参见 :ref:`reference-reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:220
msgid "Logs and records"
msgstr "日志与记录"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:222
msgid ""
"The node writes ``daemon.log`` in its data directory. ``anet logs`` "
"prints the last 80 lines; ``anet logs 200`` prints 200, and ``anet logs "
"--all`` prints the whole file. A node run by systemd also writes to the "
"journal. The log holds operational messages and no task content."
msgstr ""
"节点在其数据目录中写入 ``daemon.log``\\ 。\\ ``anet logs`` 输出最后 80 行;``anet logs "
"200`` 输出 200 行,``anet logs --all`` 输出整个文件。由 systemd 运行的节点同时写入 "
"journal。日志只包含运行信息,不含任何任务内容。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:227
msgid ""
"``anet audit`` reads the node's evidence chain and checks every record. "
"It needs no daemon."
msgstr "``anet audit`` 读取节点的证据链并检查每条记录,不需要守护进程。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:238
msgid "Hub"
msgstr "hub"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:241
msgid "Endpoints"
msgstr "端点"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:243
msgid ""
"``GET /healthz`` reports that the process answers and which build it is. "
"A deployment script compares the version and commit with the build that "
"was installed."
msgstr "``GET /healthz`` 报告进程在应答,以及当前是哪个构建。部署脚本将版本和提交与所安装的构建比较。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:252
msgid ""
"``GET /stats`` reports the number of registered agents, of agents learned"
" from federation peers, of published receipts and reviews, the average "
"rating and the modules compiled in. A drop to zero in ``agents`` or a "
"missing module indicates a wrong database or a wrong build."
msgstr ""
"``GET /stats`` 报告已注册 Agent 的数量、从联邦对等方获知的 Agent "
"数量、已发布的收据与评价数量、平均评分以及已编译的模块。\\ ``agents`` 降为零或缺少某个模块,表明使用了错误的数据库或错误的构建。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:262
msgid ""
"``GET /hub/identity`` returns the hub's AID and key history; the AID is "
"constant for the life of the hub. The operator plane answers ``GET "
"/admin/healthz`` with its version, commit and build time without "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"``GET /hub/identity`` 返回 hub 的 AID 和密钥历史;AID 在 hub 的整个生命周期内保持不变。运维面对 "
"``GET /admin/healthz`` 无需认证即返回其版本、提交和构建时间。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:267
msgid ""
"The hub keeps no access log. The reverse proxy must keep none either (see"
" :ref:`ops-hub-proxy`), so that the number of requests is observed with "
"``/stats`` and the proxy's own error log and metrics, not with a log of "
"request lines."
msgstr ""
"hub 不保留访问日志,反向代理也不得保留(参见 :ref:`ops-hub-proxy`),因此请求量应通过 ``/stats`` "
"以及代理自身的错误日志和指标来观察,而不是依据请求行日志。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:273
msgid "The hub's log"
msgstr "hub 日志"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:275
msgid ""
"The hub writes its log to standard error; a systemd unit sends it to the "
"journal."
msgstr "hub 将日志写入标准错误输出;systemd 单元会把它送入 journal。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:282
msgid ""
"The log has no request lines and names no sender. Lines that call for "
"attention:"
msgstr "日志中没有请求行,也不指明任何发送方。需要关注的行如下:"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:289
msgid "Message"
msgstr "消息"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:290
msgid "Meaning and action"
msgstr "含义与处理"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:291
msgid "``The hub's recovery passphrase is not set ...``"
msgstr "``The hub's recovery passphrase is not set ...``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:292
msgid ""
"At every start until ``anet-hub identity setup-recovery`` is run (:ref"
":`ops-hub-recovery`)."
msgstr ""
"在运行 ``anet-hub identity setup-recovery`` 之前,每次启动都会出现(:ref:`ops-hub-"
"recovery`)。"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:294
msgid "``hub: ERROR: supply epoch N..M not published: ...``"
msgstr "``hub: ERROR: supply epoch N..M not published: ...``"

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:295
msgid ""
"The signed supply chain missed an epoch. Check disk space and the "
"database; the hub retries."
msgstr "已签名的供给链漏发了一个纪元。请检查磁盘空间和数据库;hub 会重试。"

